  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 713.01 Monitoring for Regulated Secondaries",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 713.01 Monitoring for Regulated Secondaries. The O/O of a community water system or non-transient, non-community water system shall monitor to determine compliance with the secondary MCLs (SMCLs) specified in Env-Dw 706, as applicable, in accordance with this part.\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #12668, eff 1-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
